# Life and Limb makes Bot1's basic Forest a 1/1 green Saproling creature land; Humility ("All creatures lose all abilities
# and have base power and toughness 1/1") then arrives. The Forest's "{T}: Add {G}" is the intrinsic ability of its basic
# land type (CR 305.6), an ability it has from the start of layer 6 like any other, and Humility's layer-6 effect takes it
# (CR 613.1f): the Forest can no longer be tapped for mana. Bot1's Plains is no Forest and no creature, so it keeps its
# "{T}: Add {W}" (the positive control). Life and Limb is no creature and keeps its ability: the Forest is still a 1/1
# green Saproling creature.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Life and Limb
Humility
Plains
Plains
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x30

